{"id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-t-predicate.md","title":"T-Predicate","display":"df-t-predicate — T-Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-t-predicate","aliases":["90-df-t-predicate"],"display":"df-t-predicate — T-Predicate","depends_on":["[[90-df-compcode]]","[[90-df-haltseq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-t-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-t-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-t-predicate — T-Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61f71a91e63627ba\" href=\"?note=61f71a91e63627ba\" title=\"90-df-compcode\">90-df-compcode</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4a2564848c03103c\" href=\"?note=4a2564848c03103c\" title=\"90-df-haltseq\">90-df-haltseq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-t-predicate-—-T-Predicate-(Kleene)\">df-t-predicate — T-Predicate (Kleene)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；计算历史与终止历史分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"61f71a91e63627ba\" href=\"?note=61f71a91e63627ba\" title=\"90-df-compcode\">90-df-compcode</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a2564848c03103c\" href=\"?note=4a2564848c03103c\" title=\"90-df-haltseq\">90-df-haltseq</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(y,e,\\vec x)\\land\\operatorname{HaltSeq}(y,e),\\qquad\nT(e,\\vec x,y):=T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(y,e,\\vec x)\\land\\operatorname{HaltSeq}(y,e),\\qquad\nT(e,\\vec x,y):=T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(e,\\vec x,y)\">\\(T(e,\\vec x,y)\\)</span>，元数由输入列固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span> 只是显式化该元数的别名。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是计算关系，不是句子理论变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。计算输出及编号族见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>；不能以任意原始递归关系替换这里的实际历史关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-t-predicate-—-T-Predicate-(Kleene)","text":"df-t-predicate — T-Predicate (Kleene)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-compcode","status":"resolved","id":"61f71a91e63627ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-compcode]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-haltseq","status":"resolved","id":"4a2564848c03103c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-haltseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-compcode","status":"resolved","id":"61f71a91e63627ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$e,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$；计算历史与终止历史分别见 [[90-df-compcode]]、[[90-df-haltseq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-haltseq","status":"resolved","id":"4a2564848c03103c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$e,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$；计算历史与终止历史分别见 [[90-df-compcode]]、[[90-df-haltseq]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"保留 $T(e,\\vec x,y)$，元数由输入列固定；$T_k$ 只是显式化该元数的别名。这里的 $T$ 是计算关系，不是句子理论变量 $T$。计算输出及编号族见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]；不能以任意原始递归关系替换这里的实际历史关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CompCode}(y,e,\\vec x)\\land\\operatorname{HaltSeq}(y,e),\\qquad\nT(e,\\vec x,y):=T_k(e,\\vec x,y)\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k).","display":true},{"tex":"T(e,\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"T_k","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":933,"backlinks":[{"id":"725681f54d4cc140","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$e,x,s,n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\varphi_e,\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)}$ 与部分值记号由 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 定义，$T_1$ 见 [[90-df-t-predicate]]。"},{"id":"19a3e9309cfd35f0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$T_k,U,\\Phi_k$ 必须是 [[90-df-t-predicate]]、[[90-df-machine-coding]]、[[90-df-program-numbering]] 的同一固定历史／输出系统。其原始递归性与覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"73df8af25850d4b3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k,e,s\\in\\mathbb N$；$T_k$ 是 [[90-df-t-predicate]] 的实际计算历史关系，$U:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是 [[90-df-machine-coding]] 的同一输出函数。"},{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_2,U,\\varphi_a^{(2)}$ 使用 [[90-df-t-predicate]]、[[90-df-machine-coding]]、[[90-df-program-numbering]] 的同一计算系统；覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。$T_2$ 不表示理论变量 $T$。"},{"id":"ccbc0a46c077469a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$T_k,U,\\Phi_k$ 必须是 [[90-df-t-predicate]]、[[90-df-machine-coding]]、[[90-df-program-numbering]] 的同一固定历史／输出系统。其原始递归性与覆盖性见 [[90-lem-program-numbering]]。"},{"id":"42029390ebbb59c5","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi,U,T_k,M_e$ 取 [[90-df-program-numbering]]、[[90-df-machine-coding]]、[[90-df-t-predicate]] 的同一固定呈示；$k\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"a606838813c14669","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$T_k$ 见 [[90-df-t-predicate]]，程序与配置编码见 [[90-df-machine-coding]]，序列算法见 [[90-lem-sequence-coding]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-t-predicate]]、[[90-df-machine-coding]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-esse